---
source: crates/jsonschema-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stdout)"
---
Dereference a JSON Schema, inlining all $ref targets

Usage: jsonschema-cli dereference [OPTIONS] <SCHEMA>

Arguments:
  <SCHEMA>  Path to the root JSON Schema file to dereference

Options:
      --resource <URI=FILE>        Register an external schema resource (may be repeated)
  -o, --output <FILE>              Write dereferenced output to FILE instead of stdout
      --connect-timeout <SECONDS>  Timeout for establishing connections (in seconds)
      --timeout <SECONDS>          Total timeout for HTTP requests (in seconds)
  -k, --insecure                   Skip TLS certificate verification (dangerous!)
      --cacert <FILE>              Path to a custom CA certificate file (PEM format)
      --offline                    Refuse to fetch remote references
  -h, --help                       Print help
